<title>POLAND: Polish wheat, rye, barley prices slip last week.</title>
<headline>Polish wheat, rye, barley prices slip last week.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat, rye and barley prices fell during last week's grain auctions, the Polish Agriculture Ministry said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>POLISH FARM AUCTION PRICES (AVERAGE)</p>
<p>   Product   week to Feb 1     previous week   yr/yr growth</p>
<p>   Wheat	57.53 zl/q	 58.46 zl/q	 17.4 pct</p>
<p>   Rye	  41.84 zl/q	 42.58 zl/q	 35.0 pct</p>
<p>   Barley     50.39 zl/q	 50.64 zl/q	 17.2 pct</p>
<p>NOTE: zl/q = zlotys per quintal.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom+48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
